@host = http://localhost:5103

### Submit an application (replace ids with real candidate/job ids)
POST {{host}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "jobId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### List all applications
GET {{host}}/applications

### List applications for a candidate
GET {{host}}/applications?candidateId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List applications for a job
GET {{host}}/applications?jobId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update application status (Submitted -> InReview -> Accepted | Rejected)
PUT {{host}}/applications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InReview"
}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
